    "readme_description": "Given an integer `n`, return `true` if and only if it is an **Armstrong number**.\n\nThe `k`-digit number `n` is an Armstrong number if and only if the `k^th` power of each digit sums to `n`.",
    "_readme_examples": {
        "list": [
            {
                "content": "```\nInput: n = 153\nOutput: true\nExplanation: 153 is a 3-digit number, and 153 = 1^3 + 5^3 + 3^3.\n```"
            },
            {
                "content": "```\nInput: n = 123\nOutput: false\nExplanation: 123 is a 3-digit number, and 123 != 1^3 + 2^3 + 3^3 = 36.\n```"
            }
        ]
